
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title id="doc-title">AegisRadar 360 AI - جامعة نينوى Suite</title>

  <!-- Libraries -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js"></script>
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/mqtt/dist/mqtt.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/camera_utils/camera_utils.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/pose/pose.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>

  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; }
    body { background-color: #020617; color: #f8fafc; overflow: hidden; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; position: fixed; }
    #canvas-container { width: 100vw; height: 100vh; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 1; }
    
    .glass-panel {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .hud-title {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38bdf8, #34d399, #f43f5e);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .cad-btn { transition: all 0.2s ease; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); cursor: pointer; }
    .cad-btn.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #0369a1) !important;
      border-color: #38bdf8 !important;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.5);
    }
    .nav-btn {
      background: #1e293b; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; transition: 0.2s; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .nav-btn.active, .nav-btn:hover { background: #0284c7; color: #fff; border-color: #38bdf8; }
    .step-screen {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 100; background: #020617;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 16px;
    }
    .scanline {
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0), rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));
      background-size: 100% 4px; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .collapsed .panel-content { display: none !important; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 3px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #334155; border-radius: 4px; }
    .read-only-disabled { opacity: 0.5; pointer-events: none; filter: grayscale(1); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 1. الشاشات التعريفية -->
  <div id="step-1" class="step-screen">
    <div class="glass-panel max-w-lg w-full p-6 text-center border border-cyan-500/40 shadow-2xl">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-600 to-emerald-500 rounded-2xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/30 mb-3 animate-pulse">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-2xl text-white"></i>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-black hud-title mb-1 system-title-text">AegisRadar 360 AI</h1>
      <h2 class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-3">نظام المراقبة الهندسية وإدارة المنازل الذكية ثلاثي الأبعاد</h2>
      
      <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border-r-4 border-cyan-500 p-2.5 text-right text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300 mb-3 rounded">
        نظام أمني هجين يدمج حساس الرادار المليمتري (LD2450) مع محرك تقييم الوضعية والرؤية الحاسوبية.
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-right text-xs border border-slate-800 mb-4 space-y-1">
        <p>👨‍🏫 <b>إشراف الأستاذ القدير:</b> <span id="supervisor-display" class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">إبراهيم</span></p>
        <p>👨‍💻 <b>إعداد الطلاب:</b> <span id="students-display" class="text-emerald-400">غانم فراس | سما غسان | إبراهيم غسان</span></p>
        <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 pt-0.5">جامعة نينوى - كلية الهندسة</p>
      </div>

      <button onclick="goToStep(2)" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-500 hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg transition text-xs">
        المتابعة لإعدادات الدخول ➔
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="step-2" class="step-screen hidden">
    <div class="glass-panel max-w-md w-full p-5 text-center border border-cyan-500/30">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold hud-title mb-3">🔒 مصادقة حماية النظام</h2>
      
      <div class="mb-3 text-right">
        <label class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-bold block mb-1">حساب المستخدم:</label>
        <select id="user-role-select" onchange="updatePinHint()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs text-slate-200">
          <option value="admin">المهندس غانم (مدير النظام - Admin)</option>
          <option value="operator">المشرف الأمني (Security Operator)</option>
          <option value="viewer">حساب مراقب (View Only)</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-4 text-right">
        <label class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-bold block mb-1">رمز الدخول الأمني (PIN):</label>
        <input type="password" id="pin-input" maxlength="8" placeholder="••••" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 p-2.5 text-center text-lg text-cyan-400 font-mono" />
        <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">عنوان IP الحالي: <span id="user-ip-display" class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">جاري الجلب...</span></p>
      </div>

      <button onclick="authenticateUser()" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-emerald-600 text-white font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs">
        دخول النظام 🔓
      </button>
      <p id="auth-error" class="text-xs text-red-400 mt-2 hidden">رمز الدخول غير صحيح أو أن حسابك محظور!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. البيئة الرئيسية -->
  <div id="main-app" class="hidden relative w-full h-full">
    <div id="canvas-container"></div>
    <video id="webcam-video" class="hidden" autoplay playsinline webkit-playsinline muted></video>

    <!-- Header Panel -->
    <div class="glass-panel absolute top-2 right-2 left-2 z-20 p-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full sm:w-auto">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 space-x-reverse">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-600 to-emerald-500 p-1.5 rounded-lg shadow-md shadow-cyan-500/30">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-sm text-white"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h1 class="font-black text-xs hud-title system-title-text">AegisRadar 360 AI</h1>
            <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-400">المستخدم: <span id="active-user-display" class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">---</span> <span id="permission-badge" class="ml-1 px-1 bg-cyan-900 text-cyan-300 rounded text-[8px]"></span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button onclick="logout()" class="sm:hidden bg-slate-800 text-red-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-700">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-power-off"></i>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation Tabs -->
      <div class="flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto w-full sm:w-auto justify-start sm:justify-center py-1">
        <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="switchTab('dashboard', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line ml-1"></i> المراقبة</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('architect', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles ml-1"></i> البناء الذكي</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('faces', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear ml-1"></i> الوجوه</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('security', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat ml-1"></i> الخطر والـ IP</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('settings', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders ml-1"></i> الإعدادات والأمان</button>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2">
        <button id="sensor-btn" onclick="connectMQTT()" class="bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500 flex items-center gap-1">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-plug text-amber-300"></i> الرادار
        </button>
        <button onclick="logout()" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-red-400 text-xs p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-power-off"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 1: DASHBOARD -->
    <div id="tab-dashboard" class="tab-content relative z-10 pointer-events-none w-full h-full pt-20 pb-16 px-2 overflow-y-auto max-h-screen">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pointer-events-auto max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        
        <!-- Pose & Camera Panel -->
        <div id="panel-pose" class="glass-panel p-3 relative">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1.5 border-b border-slate-800 pb-1">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera text-cyan-400"></i> الكاميرا وتحليل الوضعية</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <button onclick="toggleCollapse('panel-pose')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i></button>
              <button onclick="hidePanel('panel-pose')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="panel-content">
            <div class="relative w-full h-40 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 mb-1">
              <canvas id="ai-canvas" class="w-full h-full object-cover relative z-10"></canvas>
              <div class="scanline absolute inset-0 z-20"></div>
              <div class="absolute top-1.5 left-1.5 z-30 bg-slate-950/80 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-cyan-500/40">
                <p class="text-[8px] text-slate-400">الوضعية:</p>
                <p id="hud-pose-text" class="text-[10px] font-black text-emerald-400 font-mono">جاري التشغيل...</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="startCameraManual()" class="w-full bg-cyan-900/60 hover:bg-cyan-800 border border-cyan-700 text-cyan-300 text-[10px] p-1 rounded flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> إعادة تشغيل الكاميرا
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chart Analytics -->
        <div id="panel-chart" class="glass-panel p-3 relative">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1.5 border-b border-slate-800 pb-1">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-cyan-400"></i> تحليلات المسافة</h3>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <button onclick="toggleCollapse('panel-chart')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i></button>
              <button onclick="hidePanel('panel-chart')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-content h-40 w-full">
            <canvas id="analyticsChart"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Security Logs -->
        <div id="panel-logs" class="glass-panel p-3 relative">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1.5 border-b border-slate-800 pb-1">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat text-amber-400"></i> السجل الأمني الأحداث</h3>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <button onclick="toggleCollapse('panel-logs')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i></button>
              <button onclick="hidePanel('panel-logs')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="panel-content space-y-2">
            <div id="security-logs" class="space-y-1.5 h-28 overflow-y-auto text-[10px] pr-1"></div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 text-center text-xs pt-1 border-t border-slate-800">
              <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-1 rounded border border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[9px]">إحداثي X</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 font-mono" id="raw-x">0.00 m</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-1 rounded border border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[9px]">إحداثي Z</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 font-mono" id="raw-y">0.00 m</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 2: ADVANCED REALISTIC ARCHITECT -->
    <div id="tab-architect" class="tab-content hidden relative z-10 pointer-events-none w-full h-full">
      <div id="panel-architect" class="absolute top-16 right-2 left-2 sm:left-auto sm:w-80 pointer-events-auto glass-panel p-3 flex flex-col gap-2 max-h-[82vh] overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-800 pb-1">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles text-amber-300"></i> البناء الهندسي الواقعي (3D)</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <button onclick="toggleCollapse('panel-architect')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i></button>
            <button onclick="hidePanel('panel-architect')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="panel-content space-y-2 admin-only-container">
          <!-- Floor, Angle & Background Controls -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 text-xs">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-slate-400 text-[9px] mb-0.5">الطابق الحالي:</label>
              <select id="floorSelect" onchange="changeFloor(this.value)" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 p-1 rounded text-cyan-400 font-bold text-xs">
                <option value="0">الأرضي (0)</option>
                <option value="1">الأول (1)</option>
                <option value="2">الثاني (2)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-slate-400 text-[9px] mb-0.5">اتجاه التدوير (زاوية):</label>
              <select id="angleSelect" onchange="updateRotationAngle(this.value)" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 p-1 rounded text-emerald-400 font-bold text-xs">
                <option value="0">0° (أفقي)</option>
                <option value="45">45° (قطري)</option>
                <option value="90">90° (عمودي)</option>
                <option value="135">135° (معاكس)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Site Background Selection -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-slate-400 text-[9px] mb-0.5">خلفية ورؤية الموقع:</label>
            <select id="bgSelect" onchange="changeSiteBackground(this.value)" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 p-1 rounded text-amber-300 font-bold text-xs">
              <option value="dark">النمط الليلي الأمني (Cyber Dark)</option>
              <option value="sky">السماء الواقعية (Realistic Sky)</option>
              <option value="grid">الفضاء الشبكي (Blueprint Grid)</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <!-- AI Advanced Architect Suite -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-cyan-500/40 text-xs space-y-2">
            <span class="text-cyan-300 font-bold block text-[11px]"><i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney text-amber-400 ml-1"></i> مولّد الغرف والأبنية:</span>
            
            <div>
              <label class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 block mb-0.5">نوع التصميم:</label>
              <select id="aiRoomType" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 rounded p-1 text-[11px] text-slate-200">
                <option value="living">غرفة معيشة متكاملة (جدران + أبواب + نوافذ)</option>
                <option value="office">مكتب أمني مغلق (جدران سميكة + باب)</option>
                <option value="hall">صالة زجاجية مفتوحة (واجهة زجاجية)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 block mb-0.5">المساحة:</label>
              <select id="aiRoomSize" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 rounded p-1 text-[11px] text-slate-200">
                <option value="4">صغيرة (4x4 م)</option>
                <option value="6" selected>متوسطة (6x6 م)</option>
                <option value="8">كبيرة (8x8 م)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <button id="tool-ai-room" onclick="setCadTool('ai-room')" class="cad-btn w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-500 hover:to-blue-500 p-2 rounded text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-1 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> انقر على الخريطة للتشييد
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Manual CAD Tools -->
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block pt-1">أدوات البناء اليدوي:</span>
          <div id="cad-tools-panel" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
            <button id="tool-select" onclick="setCadTool('select')" class="cad-btn active p-1.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 justify-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-pointer text-cyan-400"></i> تحديد</button>
            <button id="tool-wall" onclick="setCadTool('wall')" class="cad-btn p-1.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 justify-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-cube text-emerald-400"></i> جدار واقعي</button>
            <button id="tool-door" onclick="setCadTool('door')" class="cad-btn p-1.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 justify-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-door-closed text-amber-300"></i> باب خشب</button>
            <button id="tool-window" onclick="setCadTool('window')" class="cad-btn p-1.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 justify-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-window-restore text-cyan-300"></i> شباك زجاج</button>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1 mt-2">
            <button onclick="saveCADDesign()" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white p-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> حفظ التصميم 💾
            </button>
            <button onclick="clearCADObjects()" class="bg-red-950/60 hover:bg-red-900/80 text-red-300 p-1.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold border border-red-800/50 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-trash-can"></i> مسح الخريطة
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 3: FACE CAPTURE & DATABASE -->
    <div id="tab-faces" class="tab-content hidden relative z-10 pointer-events-none w-full h-full">
      <div id="panel-faces" class="absolute top-16 right-2 left-2 sm:left-auto sm:w-80 pointer-events-auto glass-panel p-3 flex flex-col gap-2 max-h-[80vh] overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-800 pb-1">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera-retro"></i> التقاط وخزن وجوه المستخدمين</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <button onclick="toggleCollapse('panel-faces')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i></button>
            <button onclick="hidePanel('panel-faces')" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 text-xs px-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="panel-content space-y-2">
          <div class="admin-only-container space-y-2">
            <input type="text" id="faceNameInput" placeholder="اسم الشخص" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 p-1.5 rounded text-slate-200 text-xs">
            <button onclick="captureFace()" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white p-1.5 rounded font-bold text-xs transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-expand"></i> التقاط وصنع بصمة وجه 📸
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block mb-1">الوجوه المحفوظة بالنظام:</span>
            <div id="faces-gallery" class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5 max-h-40 overflow-y-auto"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TAB 4: DANGER ZONES & IP AUDIT -->
    <div id="tab-security" class="tab-content hidden relative z-10 pointer-events-none w-full h-full">
